    <title>vol.36 手搓全女团队婚礼｜两个 90 后女生的真实婚礼体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab5f3dae742e36efcbb0c3c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab5f3dae742e36efcbb0c3c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 04:13:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家中秋快乐🎑！本期播客内容为两个 90 后女生的真实婚礼体验！曾经誓死不办婚礼的 90 后，一个硬核手搓全女天团趣味婚礼，花式整活拒绝流水线表演；一个甩给长辈包办，惨遭婚宴隐形套路暴击。吐槽套路、爆哭名场面轮番上演，推翻对婚礼的刻板认知，快来听听吧～</span></p><p><span>【婚礼进行曲】</span></p><ol><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a>‑<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a></span></strong><span>｜主播回归！消失期双双解锁结婚副本，开启 90 后婚礼大吐槽分享局。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a>‑<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">03:55</a></span></strong><span>｜曾经执念旅行结婚耍酷，为啥最后打脸，老老实实办起婚礼？</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">03:56</a>‑<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="323">05:23</a></span></strong><span>｜酷到炸裂！耗时四月，墨墨搭起全套全女阵容，亲手包办整场婚礼。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="324">05:24</a>‑<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a></span></strong><span>｜躺平交给长辈办婚礼，却踩婚宴消费圈套，专拿 “喜事不计较” 割韭菜。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a>‑<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1052">17:32</a></span></strong><span>｜打卡网红一站式婚礼，新人像演戏走流程，年轻人厌的是模板不是仪式。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1053">17:33</a>‑<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1227">20:27</a></span></strong><span>｜放弃豪华宴会厅！选定蓝色港湾玻璃花房，定下婚礼两大硬核准则。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">20:28</a>‑<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1527">25:27</a></span></strong><span>｜扭蛋抽戒指、墨镜拍照、DIY 调酒，花式脑洞环节，闺蜜硬核自学来助阵。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1528">25:28</a>‑<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a></span></strong><span>｜本想完美对口型唱歌入场，现场新郎爆哭新娘笑场，真实胜过一切彩排。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1901">31:41</a>‑<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2268">37:48</a></span></strong><span>｜办完婚礼才懂被见证有多幸福！复盘当年缺席闺蜜婚礼的内心忏悔。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2269">37:49</a>‑<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2501">41:41</a></span></strong><span>｜婚后深夜复盘到凌晨，最大成就感不是自己圆梦，是让宾客玩得尽兴。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2502">41:42</a>‑<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2868">47:48</a></span></strong><span>｜餐盘藏惊喜，分桌定制伴手礼，经费花在热爱细节，拒绝传统婚宴硬菜套路。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2869">47:49</a>‑<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3210">53:30</a></span></strong><span>｜婚礼名场面！新娘登台隔空对视闺蜜，一个眼神就戳破泪点。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3211">53:31</a>‑<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3382">56:22</a></span></strong><span>｜比起伴侣誓词，多年闺蜜送戒指发言，才是戳中新娘泪崩的杀招。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3383">56:23</a>‑<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3763">1:02:43</a></span></strong><span>｜朗读甜蜜誓词，鼓励大家静待看见你闪光点的爱人，爱人与被爱即是幸福！</span></p></li></ol><p><span>【友友们集合啦！】</span></p><p><span>欢迎大家扫描下方二维码👇加入听友群交流💗</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhUrAnCOyBjIoMdWGr8FSidTbx6N.jpg"></figure><p><span>或者可以添加Liiionaaa-_拉你进群～👇</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo1BDp2zJQKOFxjm9dJ0Cn7LPeXp.jpg"></figure><p><span>【关于主播】</span></p><p><span>两位生活在北京的都市打工人，性格迥异但完美互补的大龄少女👭</span></p><p><span>懒懒不懒：可爱御姐entj，喜欢社会学、心理学、教育学、玄学与哲学的纯理科生，在形而上的道路上天马行空一发不可收拾的心灵探索家。</span></p><p><span>墨墨：美女霸总estp，在生活中搞田野调查的非严肃历史学者，对万事万物都会产生好奇并且要亲自尝试的冒险家。</span></p><p><span>【播客发布】</span></p><p><span>小宇宙、苹果播客、喜马拉雅、荔枝、网易云音乐、QQ音乐同步更新</span></p><p><span>【本期制作】</span></p><p><span>内容编辑：墨墨、懒懒不懒</span></p><p><span>音频剪辑：懒懒不懒</span></p><p><span>bgm：Traverser——Emma Peters</span></p>]]></description>
